# Twin Dragons graphics corruption

- Source URL: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/NES_MiSTer/issues/146

In Twin Dragons ([https://www.brokestudio.fr/en/shop/twin-dragons-2/](url)) you encounter signs that activate a tutorial screen. Exiting out of one will result in a corrupted screen. Walking away and back restores the correct graphics.

